The KPI will be dispatched to all universities by the MOE all around Ethiopian universities. Arba Minch is one of them. After Arbaminch University receives the KPIs, they will be dispatched to all the university's parts by the strategic office. But before the KPI is dispatched by the strategic offices, it should be registered on the system by the system administrator. After that, the strategic office will have access to them. Then the strategic office will dispatch the KPIs to the below offices, which are the vice presidents. There are around three vice presidents, but there could be more or less than that. Everything should be configurable. Under each vice president there is a higher institution. There are a couple of higher institutions. Under this institution there are faculties; under the faculties there are chairs; under the chairs there are staff. The KPIs that are going to be dispatched do not pass the faculty level because most of the KPIs are general and can be performed on the faculty level, but the faculty head should dispatch another kind of KPI depending on the available KPIs. To make it clear, the faculty dean will see all the KPIs dispatched by the higher institutions above it, and then he can select one or more original KPIs dispatched from the higher institution and create another synthetic KPI that the chair and staff will work on. Then the chairs will receive a synthetic KPI created by the faculty and then dispatch it to the staff. For every synthetic KPI that is received, the staff should submit a report or fill out a performance every quarter. If the original KPI that the faculty dispatched needs the evidence to be uploaded, the faculty dean must also provide evidence for the synthetic KPI created with those original KPIs. All the staff performance should add up to represent the chair's performance when displayed on the faculty level or dashboard. After the faculty dean receives the performance of each quarter on the synthetic KPI from the chairs, which is from the combined performance of all staff under that chair. Then he will manually fill the quarter performance of the original KPI depending on the data of the synthetic KPI. Then after the faculty submit the report or the performance, the combined data will be shown on the higher institutions' dashboard, but the higher institutions have to submit their report manually on the quarter by combining the performance that has come from below plus their office performance and submitting the report, and this chain continues until they reach the strategic office. The overall combined performance of the university will be displayed in the strategic office report. Each and every role other than the staff has the report page. On the report page, they can see the report for each quarter or half-year or yearly performance. They can download it in PDF or Excel format. The performance is labeled in color according to the configuration by the admin. For everything, there should be a log in the admin log page for every action, like logging in, filling out the KPI quarterly performance by everyone, profile, and anything necessary. The other thing is that the notification will be sent to the KPI receiver when they receive the KPI and others.